#: templates/landing/landing_page.html:18
msgid "landingPageWelcomeText"
msgstr "Welcome to the Just Good Work Data Platform."

#: templates/landing/landing_page.html:19
msgid "landingPageIntroText"
msgstr ""
"The Just Good Work data platform offers information, data and insights about"
" migrant labour. This includes issues that affect migrants from when they "
"are looking for work in their home countries, through their experience "
"migrating and working until they finish. Through this platform, we hope to "
"shed light on the issues that not only affect migrant workers, but also lead"
" to inefficiencies in labour supply chains. This resource is to provide "
"insight and support that will help individuals, organizations, and "
"governments to combat modern slavery and protect the rights of migrant "
"workers."

